  "question": {
    "text": "The number of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a tautology, is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "slLAV",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
